/P 42 0 R
/T (Mechatrolix is a specialist industrial automation consultancy offering integrated EC&I, PLC programming, SCADA development, Robot programming, and functional safety services to manufacturers, process plants, and OEMs across Southern Africa and beyond. We bridge the gap between engineering design and operational reality, delivering compliant, robust, and maintainable automation solutions that meet international safety standards from concept through commissioning. Our work spans the full automation lifecycle: electrical specification and schematic design, controller programming, supervisory system integration, robot programming, and project management, under a single accountable engineering partner.)
/E (Mechatrolix is a specialist industrial automation consultancy offering integrated EC&I, PLC programming, SCADA development, Robot programming, and functional safety services to manufacturers, process plants, and OEMs across Southern Africa and beyond. We bridge the gap between engineering design and operational reality, delivering compliant, robust, and maintainable automation solutions that meet international safety standards from concept through commissioning. Our work spans the full automation lifecycle: electrical specification and schematic design, controller programming, supervisory system integration, robot programming, and project management, under a single accountable engineering partner.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [9]
>>
